kerf-recipe 1
# The camera of a shot found from its frames: the guide of the camera going round the car,
# drawn as its picture, with where a model puts the camera on each frame beside
# the depth it agrees on across them.
render s3 {guide.mp4} size=832x480 rate=16
generate model=cameras guide={guide.mp4} out={cameras.txt}
generate model=cameras guide={guide.mp4}
